  "title": {
    "type": "text",
    "$t": "台文通訊BONG報334期-編輯室ê話"
  },
  "content": {
    "type": "html",
    "$t": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\">新曆年開工，逐家新年連假kám有去佗se̍h-se̍h行行--leh？Iah是kap朋友做伙話仙hānn年，hōo新年有一个真鬧熱、燒lō ê起頭？新年頭一期雜誌tshuân tsiok濟好料hōo逐家。先來看〈雞腿飯ê滋味〉到底hōo人想起啥mih心適ê記持？〈脆柿仔〉 教lán柿仔欉ài按怎顧hōo tiâu，khah bē果子未曾熟，就hōo膨鼠食了了。〈美食外送〉tsit項因為疫情tshìng--起-來ê產業，按怎hōo lán ê生活ke khah利便，koh thang hōo食si̍t換款--一-下？「台語」是永遠bē退流行ê主題。〈歇熱ê台語生活〉是國校仔學生認真準備演講比賽ê心情故事。〈Tâi-gí Lō͘〉kā m̄願hìnn-sak母語，tī成長ê逐个階段沓沓仔累積語言能力ê過程記--落-來。〈台語kah我ê專業〉內底，拄做媽媽ê作者，按怎因為教囝來智覺著台語ê重要性？除了食飽飽、講母語，新年上重要--ê，當然是身體勇健。來看是按怎〈行路上心適、行路上健身〉？若去〈深坑仔ê步道〉行行看看--leh，凡勢ē-tàng hōo你規年thàng天精神百倍őo！</span></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"></p><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><a href=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGOF9YsQBv4gIcZzNmg2vE1OOZCJZdVaW5SCN3IBeJbQaL6WOza6xTSjLw4chbjF9jIq_zlflx6RQUQ7xsFuQE26H4KUf3cGzxd9gEVXNhppvZZkA6w9tcAprG5A6GSkaFuSJdUSYx-5XewGwxD0OY9WFtybh8yVyccS39RUvrFW9TNNMx41wbDKApCw=s1424\" imageanchor=\"1\" style=\"margin-left: 1em; margin-right: 1em;\"><img border=\"0\" data-original-height=\"1424\" data-original-width=\"1000\" height=\"640\" src=\"https://blogger.googleusercontent.com/img/a/AVvXsEiGOF9YsQBv4gIcZzNmg2vE1OOZCJZdVaW5SCN3IBeJbQaL6WOza6xTSjLw4chbjF9jIq_zlflx6RQUQ7xsFuQE26H4KUf3cGzxd9gEVXNhppvZZkA6w9tcAprG5A6GSkaFuSJdUSYx-5XewGwxD0OY9WFtybh8yVyccS39RUvrFW9TNNMx41wbDKApCw=w450-h640\" width=\"450\" /></a></div><br /><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span><p></p><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><br /></span></p><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><b>台文通訊BONG報334期，2022年1月出刊。</b></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both; text-align: center;\"><br /></div></div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-family: inherit;\"><br /></span></div><p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"></span></p><div style=\"background-color: white; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px; text-align: justify;\"><div align=\"center\"><div style=\"margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><h3><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">歡迎捐款贊助　#李江却台語文教基金會　</span></span></h3><h3 style=\"text-align: left;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #274e13; font-size: large; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\">（捐款可抵稅，匯款後請通知02-23112199）</span></div><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><div style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"color: #38761d;\"><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(定期定額) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/Period/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span><span style=\"text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span>線上捐款(單筆) </span><a href=\"https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk\" target=\"_blank\">https://donate.newebpay.com/akhioh/lkk</a></div></span></span></span><span style=\"color: #274e13; text-align: justify;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">郵政劃撥：19021486</div><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></div><span style=\"white-space: pre-wrap;\"><div style=\"text-align: center;\">電匯：123-20-050514-2</div><div style=\"text-align: center;\">華南銀行士林分行活儲</div></span><div style=\"text-align: center; white-space: pre-wrap;\">戶名：財團法人李江却台語文教基金會</div></span></span></h3><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #050505; text-align: justify; white-space: pre-wrap;\"><br /></span></span></div><span style=\"font-family: &quot;Times New Roman&quot;; text-align: left;\"></span></div><div style=\"font-family: helvetica, arial, sans-serif; margin-bottom: 6px; margin-top: 6px;\"><span style=\"color: #38761d; font-size: 15px;\"><br /></span></div><div class=\"separator\" style=\"clear: both;\"></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">李江却台語文教基金會需要你ê定期捐款，逐個月捐助NT$200以上，lán做伙來推動復振台灣語文ê事工，歡迎利用劃撥、電匯、信用卡、郵局『存簿儲金自動轉帳』扣款iah是線頂捐款、現金贊助。</span><br /><span style=\"color: #999999;\"><br /></span></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #999999; font-size: medium;\"></span></div></div><div style=\"text-align: start;\"><div><div style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"font-size: medium;\"><span style=\"color: #999999;\">◎逐個月贊助本會（台文通訊BONG報發行單位）NT$200（iah是逐冬NT$2,400）以上，</span><span style=\"color: #999999;\">做伙支持基金會事工kap雜誌編印發行費用。歡迎利用郵局劃撥、信用卡（寫捐款單）、線頂捐款、現金贊助、銀行/ATM轉帳（轉帳了後請通知）、支票、郵局戶頭自動轉帳扣繳（寫授權書），捐款收據ē-tàng做『列舉扣除額』抵稅ê用途。</span></span></div></div></div></div></div>"
  },
